{"title":"1965 AHSME Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_10\">Problem 10</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 10\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The statement <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/0/2b0d35f17b5e048c5ae03d6c79945357e888b5b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 - x - 6 &lt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"114\" height=\"15\" /> is equivalent to the statement: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/a/26a38f92342646ab483dc44b5fd88a4e71a91f3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ - 2 &lt; x &lt; 3 \\qquad  \\textbf{(B) }\\ x &gt; - 2 \\qquad  \\textbf{(C) }\\ x &lt; 3 \\\\ \\textbf{(D) }\\ x &gt; 3 \\text{ and }x &lt; - 2 \\qquad  \\textbf{(E) }\\ x &gt; 3 \\text{ or }x &lt; - 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"1052\" height=\"38\" />   \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>To solve this problem, we may begin by factoring <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/5/f457734a0439f6ebaf1beda84705a92da6867674.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2-x-6$\" width=\"81\" height=\"15\" /> as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b1306fc460e4e7a52390b29cddd7febbe917706a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x-3)(x+2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"110\" height=\"18\" />. This is an upward opening parabola, therefore the solutions to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/5/5a5d1798d724da36ff3f8541553da7f1f845e1cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x-3)(x+2) &lt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"144\" height=\"18\" /> are between the roots of the equation. That means our solutions are all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/d/5dd70d584e49767198c31341010fb9a3b4293dcc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-2 &lt; x &lt; 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"90\" height=\"13\" />, or simply <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/e/35e8ea2d16518197b5113002b8c0c7da6c311a3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"41\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME\" title=\"1965 AHSME\">1965 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1965 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1965 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1965\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1965 AHS